flowchart TD
  U[Tenant member] --> API[API + schema validation]
  API --> IAM[Membership + tenant context]
  IAM --> ING[Ingestion + provenance]
  ING --> DOC[(Document store)]
  ING --> IDX[(Tenant/ACL retrieval index)]
  IAM --> RAG[RAG query service]
  RAG --> IDX
  RAG --> CV[Citation verifier]
  CV --> ANS[Cited answer or abstention]
  IAM --> AG[Agent planner: proposal only]
  AG --> PG[Tool policy + approval]
  PG --> IDEM[Idempotency ledger]
  IDEM --> TOOL[Tool executor]
  API --> OBS[Redacted audit + trace + cost]
  RAG --> OBS
  PG --> OBS
  X[Untrusted retrieved text / model output] -. cannot authorize .-> PG
